# Titles for news and blog

Follow `STYLE.adoc` and `AGENTS.md`. Philosophy: `/blog/titles-as-orientation/`.

- First-party news omits the org (notification line).
- Action essays: implied [On]; drop surplus *the*.
- Prefer *as* / *when* / disproof / questions over rigid *X is Y*.
- Attach floating modifiers to an object.
